<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova 1996 foreign trade gap grew to $277.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Moldova 1996 foreign trade gap grew to $277.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldova's foreign trade deficit widened to $277.6 million in 1996 from $80.6 million in 1995, an official from the State Statistics Department told Reuters.</p>
<p>    MOLDOVAN FOREIGN TRADE	Jan-Dec'96    Jan-Dec '95</p>
<p>    Exports ($ million)		   801.6	   745.5</p>
<p>    Imports			   1,079.2	   826.1</p>
<p>    Balance			    -277.6	   -80.6</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
